  "review": {
    "gallery": "Eleven native-resolution design renders are extracted from the project brochure. Three actual enabling-works photographs come from Deyaar’s DWTN construction update. Its report has no visible inspection date, so photo captions do not assign one. The complete skyline render keeps the tower within the cover frame.",
